{"id":"n61395-6-5","stage":2,"title":"따다 · 摘录","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61395-6-5-1","ko":"딸 이름은 정했어?","zh":"女儿的名字定下来了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"딸","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이름은","meaning":"名字","explanation":"이름：名字；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"2","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정했어?","meaning":"定，选定","explanation":"정하다：定，选定；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"1","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"名字","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"附加于人的姓氏后面的，只称呼其人的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"2b712f8bfe2006eb","term":"정하다","zh":"定，选定","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3","entryId":"29767","definition":"从几个里面选一个。","pronunciation":["정ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5909c8ac06b25dc0aea1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61395-6-5-2","ko":"응. 나랑 남편 이름을 한 글자씩 따서 지을 거야.","zh":"嗯。打算从我跟我丈夫的名字里各取一个字来给她取名。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나랑","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남편","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이름을","meaning":"名字","explanation":"이름：名字；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"2","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"글자씩","meaning":"字，文字","explanation":"글자：字，文字；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"글자","audio":"/audio/068c2631228200cfd63e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62490","senseId":"1","lemma":"글자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따서","meaning":"摘录","explanation":"따다：摘录；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"따다","audio":"/audio/2568b45d590064759f23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61395","senseId":"6","lemma":"따다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지을","meaning":"取，起","explanation":"짓다：取，起；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"짓다","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66585","senseId":"12","lemma":"짓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe545